            <ArticleTitle>Managing chronic pain in older people.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>26-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article presents the results of a collaborative project between the British Pain Society and British Geriatric Society to produce guidelines on the management of pain in older adults. The guidelines are the first of their kind in the UK and aim to provide best practice for the management of pain to all health professionals working with older adults in any care setting.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
